{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "3948ee3c1f8b4fe3bbc1b8336735584d91b7d9665d0f819bb3380c2172e148eb", "ja": "過去", "zh": "过去", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e6acac2b3a7fd0f4c361f2bf8fe2e8daaa597d8076a68be4f3b9940a8fda7925", "ja": "神宮寺に会いに行く真珠星。神宮寺は、自分\nが真珠星の実の母親であることを認める。\n十数年前、神宮寺は御梨音プロの優秀な社員\nとして活躍していた。同僚である婚約者との\n間に子供も授かり未来は明るいはずだった。", "zh": "真珠星前往与神宫寺相见。神宫寺承认自己是真珠星的亲生母亲。\n十几年前，神宫寺曾是御梨音事务所的优秀员工，活跃于职场。与同为同事的未婚夫喜得一子，本以为前途一片光明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "411561f1e018d65e5d834ae4a3665ce62db329be55742e1e2349cc96efd139fa", "ja": "（私が、一宮の家の養子……？\n本当のお母さんは……神宮寺さん……？）", "zh": "（我是……一宫家的养女……？\n我的亲生母亲是……神宫寺女士……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "48d4130970ecfd948120acd85fbd5e89bc35c786564c86a84dc1f1094ad287ed", "ja": "（突然過ぎて、何がなんだか……。\nでも、直接聞くのが一番早いはずだから……）", "zh": "（事情来得太突然，我完全搞不清楚状况……\n不过，直接问应该是最快的办法……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "3f540587b533ab8d5f70053e990166a772e8cc5634ff93daffb9a1f5a440df08", "ja": "お待たせ、真珠星。あなたが\n私と二人きりで話したいなんて、珍しいわね。", "zh": "让你久等了，真珠星。你难得会想和我单独聊聊呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "94fb1a3df0253c0bd8e43ad955d5e43ca903ea5228c2e86a945a584e13d659ee", "ja": "神宮寺さん……。", "zh": "神宫寺……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "2e92b4c69630dd1f2624f795f1684e1f468be7810c7bf26b0b41781a47dee7ec", "ja": "！　その机の紙は……。", "zh": "！那张桌上的纸是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "f98dab30e4b18d000cb2cd7eecbb23042cca5c351c2feb1117b3bf9a86b93e13", "ja": "パスポートを、取りに行こうとして……。\nそれで……。", "zh": "我正准备去拿护照……  \n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "b09be2d3f1e7ef57040fe3f59158ac58cba2a97596bcc94e362b4b6b473542ed", "ja": "そう……戸籍謄本を見たのね。私が委任状で、\nさっさと取りに行くべきだったわ。", "zh": "这样啊……你看到户籍誊本了。早知道我就该拿着委托书，赶紧去取的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "4984223e163073e0a5cff2136a874185a15dc7c3a18fcc34745d372bd8adae00", "ja": "……あの！　神宮寺さんが、\n私の本当のお母さんって……！？", "zh": "……那个！神宫寺小姐是我的亲生母亲……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "7ddb730dcd29c3f857e61a4b648247f89ab94563f2cdf6a163c0a431e913eb73", "ja": "ええ。私が、あなたの母親よ。\n……少し待ってちょうだい。", "zh": "是的，我就是你的母亲。\n……请稍等。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1010_se", "source_sha256": "fab8835a5f8e3bdd4913bcb4e9a8ffa65e54a703681a2aec667ca24092cf0d0e", "ja": "ピッ", "zh": "嘀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "732876223cbbd076a52518d4f9d9a5498c257b533249f0fd9636da11ef4b9457", "ja": "藍？　久々のオフに、ごめんなさい。\n……織姫の手紙を、持ってきてもらえる？", "zh": "小蓝？难得的休息日，不好意思麻烦你。……能帮我把织姬的信拿过来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "393fe687a0ffb558247c0eb4d345f75a079baa28a48bc5500e11a5767e874467", "ja": "ええ。予定外だけど、知られてしまったの。\n真珠星に渡すわ。", "zh": "嗯。虽然出乎意料，但还是被发现了。\n我会把它交给真珠星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "aedf1745e863f54f961d1d1d51be42ce5cfae5e07b42a700c580992b2e946a55", "ja": "お姉ちゃんの、手紙……？", "zh": "姐姐的信……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "41360668a267b534ce733892531ee0c1cc9b1667c1bf67ba0b368516c25a4ab5", "ja": "織姫が、あなたに残した手紙がある。\n先に、それを読んでもらいたいの。", "zh": "有一封织姬留给你的信。我想请你先读一读。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "30fd7e63471b8328e84a04a45fdc32c8a783aaee8486c66077f2660a11757975", "ja": "その上で……質問なら、いくらでも答えるわ。", "zh": "在此基础上……你有什么问题，我都会回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "db46f8e7ebc6da29b2c07f23c523ff4ce28480b2cf5048f8ba09b0eb767b8670", "ja": "……。\nわかった……。", "zh": "……。\n我知道了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1017_null", "source_sha256": "42cce527ae16f13fd9c010de72931fe7c2cfe41cf622e60b9dd7d0c2f6e52023", "ja": "時は遡り、十数年前……", "zh": "时间回溯，十数年前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1018_mirionpurosyatyou", "source_sha256": "6a9ed059376c854e65ef9a111074b65ddea34971915181d252b671ca1fc95ac7", "ja": "先日行われた我が御梨音プロ主催の音楽フェスだが、\n知っての通り、大成功を収めた。", "zh": "前些天举行的由我御梨音制作人主办的音乐节，如你所知，取得了巨大成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1019_mirionpurosyatyou", "source_sha256": "87e891adf96d1d22b9410a18ded90fb142a019d38f49648cf21ca408d5f5aa81", "ja": "アイドル諸君はもちろん、君達の功績も大きい。\nさすがは我が社の誇る敏腕社員だ！", "zh": "各位偶像自不必说，你们的功绩也很大。\n不愧是本公司引以为傲的能干员工！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1020_syainn", "source_sha256": "61561eb70e94c0f4a8ce16856d2aa54538f66d6b514abfb964dc19b2c8ad8e99", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n早速、次の企画も彼女と始動します。", "zh": "非常感谢！\n我马上就和她一起启动下一个企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "ccb5dfa0cc0084bfbb2951d1b1e146b79d6db370c600bbe7b1a3e1f6d350f34f", "ja": "アイディアは、もう既にいくつか。\nすぐにでも企画を出します！", "zh": "点子已经有好几个了。\n我马上就会提出企划！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1022_syainn", "source_sha256": "8ff2ce3007e2c8eae4afe240d2d8b3797644c412317cc7bfd94b51c7ec4c838e", "ja": "まったく、君には本当に驚かされるな……。", "zh": "真是的，你可真是让我大吃一惊啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1024_syainn", "source_sha256": "23c342a29bb785ed5a9bb9e2195e51ed9ff99e5b7152b24ed472953bb79bc774", "ja": "あれだけ大型企画を完遂した後なのに、\nもう次のアイディアがあるなんて……。", "zh": "明明才刚完成那么大型的企划，居然已经有下一个点子了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "a5aa1ae0c6aae323729411522fa1fb257fa1b911b8a936645c226e49252fe198", "ja": "敏腕社員ですから。……それじゃあ、もうひとつ。\n驚きの事実を発表するね。", "zh": "因为我是能干的员工嘛。……那么，再告诉你一个。我要宣布一个惊人的事实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "c6389948acb315e41155ed5f81f4b05a79159dcddd1347fb60900564b326181b", "ja": "その……。\n赤ちゃんができたみたいなんだけど……。", "zh": "那个……好像有宝宝了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1027_syainn", "source_sha256": "45ef9b767c10b51ccfb262e9c1437dce7682b16e89aee68b7af4c67d36212f11", "ja": "！　僕達に、子どもが……？", "zh": "！我们、要有孩子了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "22a51d25dec47cc56c382904fc5d6b94582c12a3a28c7459eee07927c025874f", "ja": "もっと早く言えればよかったんだけど、\nフェスが無事終わるまではと思って……。", "zh": "本来要是能早点告诉你就好了，\n但我想着，至少要等音乐节顺利结束……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1029_syainn", "source_sha256": "e91db6805cf68d9d191e92273f3857065a6009d9af6a228a5014d8472aab1126", "ja": "じゃあ、もっと前にわかってて……？\nそれはダメだ、もう君ひとりのことじゃないんだ。", "zh": "那就是说，你更早之前就知道了……？\n那可不行，这已经不只是你一个人的事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1030_syainn", "source_sha256": "8608b996e4f05108fef43bbe3fb39df99e03e20750eb3e5a3660bef1ca8c4a48", "ja": "君と僕と子ども……3人で一緒にやっていかなきゃ。\nだから、もっと周りを頼って。お互いに助け合おう。", "zh": "你、我还有孩子……必须3个人一起努力才行。\n所以，多依靠一下周围的人吧。让我们互相扶持。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "64bb8c9830e4c52511df4b2e56b258bb3bd3f550704fb31787a447ff1a29a78f", "ja": "うん、そうだね。生まれる前後は、\n少しお仕事も休まなくちゃだし……。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。孩子出生前后，我也得暂时休息一阵，不能工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1032_syainn", "source_sha256": "442b41adef1d6d1cb54332653e4ed9eaa99011337817293c37818c5701cb2aec", "ja": "当然だよ。……君のご両親は亡くなっていて、\n近くに住んでいるのは、お姉さんだけだよね？", "zh": "这是当然的。……你的父母已经去世了，\n住在附近的，就只有你姐姐对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "7eb17e8b7311ec384b60dbadbbcf39a98abe4880cca48312728f6d5af093ad16", "ja": "そうなの。私とお姉ちゃんは\nおじいちゃんとおばあちゃんに育てられて……。", "zh": "是啊。我和姐姐是由爷爷奶奶抚养长大的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "49f9215a1dfa51c03a9e33d5fcbc633bb61ec94e7731e5280924d9714f7ffdbc", "ja": "でも、とっても大事にしてもらったし。\nお姉ちゃんがいるから、寂しくなかったわ。", "zh": "不过，他们一直都很疼爱我们。因为有姐姐在身边，所以我一点也不寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1035_syainn", "source_sha256": "bd8cfbe309ae56fa1032497d2db4c71b9c5ad52c99600f70713d6f565bd19f99", "ja": "これからの事を考えると、頼れる人はなるべく\n大勢いた方がいいね。うちの両親に声をかけてみるよ。", "zh": "考虑到今后的事，能依靠的人还是越多越好。我去问问我父母吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1036_syainn", "source_sha256": "b66aaed2dc049009ead41329688ff8c95446de5ddce1c601ace4675b31fd7215", "ja": "結婚報告も含めてね。\nきっと飛んできてくれるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "包括结婚报告在内，她肯定也会飞奔过来的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "db138c188e1cb37bd948ab96f281b582eed417f618ac504090a7ca714306c508", "ja": "なんだか、気が早いような……。", "zh": "总觉得，好像有点操之过急了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1038_syainn", "source_sha256": "06da6540ccce5d1ad9d376404fa7aa2f45b84bff72b9816cab52ecfffe79f7f0", "ja": "とんでもない、こういう事は急がなくちゃ。\nさあ、これから忙しくなるぞ！", "zh": "没什么，这种事得赶紧才行。  \n好了，接下来可要忙起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1039_048rei", "source_sha256": "4fd0967b8e04794837ea07c19f12dad620819430d106d266b94bcf65cf1ef0a1", "ja": "うん……ありがとう。\n一緒に、頑張ろうね。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你。\n我们一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1040_048rei", "source_sha256": "f13aced9d3442d924581a62f8ed50008b97149277a187a3b6e8fd3ae1eab7539", "ja": "（小さい頃は色々あったけど、ここまでは順風満帆。\n大好きな仕事と愛する人、幸せな人生だった）", "zh": "（小时候虽然经历过各种各样的事，但一路走到现在都顺风顺水。\n有最喜欢的工作和深爱的人，是一段幸福的人生）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0361_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_05_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "039190f3b6b0d36b0b77ded88a41395746fc36ec862465b95ca4e48d1ea7c9da", "ja": "（この先に待つ運命をまだ知らずに、\nただ純粋に、心から笑えていた……）", "zh": "（还不知道前方等待着怎样的命运，只是纯粹地、发自内心地笑着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
